# Multi-Broker Portfolio Aggregation Platform

Transform StockScout into a **unified investment command center** that aggregates equity and ETF holdings from Zerodha, Groww, and Dhan — alongside existing CSV imports — into a single intelligent dashboard with AI-powered cross-portfolio insights, alerts, and decision support.

## Design Philosophy

> **Think like a family office CIO**: Every demat account is a "sleeve" within a master portfolio. The platform should give you a single pane of glass to see total net worth, cross-account concentration risk, overlapping positions, and purpose-driven allocation — all enhanced by the AI/news intelligence engine we've already built.

