## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Broker API Keys Required**: You will need to generate API credentials from each broker's developer portal:
> - **Zerodha**: Register at [developers.kite.trade](https://developers.kite.trade/) → get `api_key` and `api_secret` (Free Personal plan, ₹0/mo)
> - **Dhan**: Go to Profile → DhanHQ Trading APIs → generate `client_id` and `access_token` (Free, ₹0/mo)
> - **Groww**: Go to Profile → Trading APIs → subscribe (₹499+tax/mo) → get API auth token

> [!WARNING]
> **Zerodha access tokens expire daily**. The user must re-login via Kite's OAuth redirect each trading day to refresh the token, unless we implement the full OAuth flow. For now, manual token paste will work for on-demand syncs. We can automate this later with the OAuth flow.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Security**: All broker credentials will be encrypted at rest using Fernet symmetric encryption before storing in the database. Tokens are never logged or exposed in API responses.

