### Phase 4: Scheduler Integration

#### [MODIFY] [scheduler_service.py](file:///c:/Stock%20AI%20tool/backend/app/services/scheduler_service.py)

Add a new daily job `job_sync_broker_holdings`:
- Runs at **6:00 AM IST** (before market opens) and **4:00 PM IST** (after market close)
- Iterates over all active `broker_accounts` and calls the sync service
- Updates `last_synced_at`, `sync_status`, and `sync_error` on each account
- Triggers alerts if any sync fails (e.g., expired Zerodha token)

